        en: 'Any of the seven listed hotels puts you within reach of the lifts, since the Bretaye cogwheel train leaves from the village itself and climbs to 1805 m, the gateway to the Villars-Gryon-Diablerets ski area. The shared area’s altitude spans 1200 m to 3000 m, at Glacier 3000, the highest point in canton Vaud.',
